{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"4076f4d3f82bae85","type":"group","x":2240,"y":-1210,"width":1840,"height":740},
		{"id":"8ad30fc8e01e1603","type":"group","x":2240,"y":-380,"width":1200,"height":1040},
		{"id":"0963854e6ca823a2","type":"group","x":420,"y":-840,"width":1150,"height":790},
		{"id":"e833367c548b9311","type":"group","x":-1340,"y":-680,"width":1580,"height":500},
		{"id":"c4b9e427061e811c","type":"group","x":1760,"y":-990,"width":300,"height":1040},
		{
			"id":"e7196a4b189e80f2",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"### Current architecture\n\n1. User\n2. mcp login\n3. mcp validates username/password\n4. mcp gives its own JWT\n5. user enters MCP application\n\nMCP does authenticate it's own users.\n**There is a validation, but it validates the MCP tenant identity, not a CRM or other application user's identity**",
			"styleAttributes":{"border":"dashed"},
			"x":500,
			"y":-797,
			"width":380,
			"height":335
		},
		{
			"id":"9ea47c69378ea90f",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"MCP App",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":-40,
			"y":-505,
			"width":260,
			"height":115,
			"color":"4"
		},
		{
			"id":"ceb8b7a7bd9f35f6",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"IAM ",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":-440,
			"y":-660,
			"width":260,
			"height":60,
			"color":"4"
		},
		{
			"id":"b57f1b00cc2cfd88",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Application \n1. CRM\n2. DD",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":-360,
			"y":-390,
			"width":280,
			"height":190,
			"color":"4"
		},
		{
			"id":"a86da819a7a8cd5b",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"ChatGPT",
			"styleAttributes":{
				"textAlign":"center",
				"border":null
			},
			"x":-920,
			"y":-420,
			"width":250,
			"height":60,
			"color":"4"
		},
		{
			"id":"10890f8d18b6f7c8",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"### In simpler words\n\n1. Current MCP says: is this a valid MCP client/tenant?\n2. New architecture must say: who is this CRM user, which organisation/workspace are they in, and are they allowed to perform this CRM action? ",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1030,
			"y":-270,
			"width":520,
			"height":180
		},
		{
			"id":"ac912740193166e9",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"1. Create plugin\n\t1. Name\n\t2. description\n\t3. URL\n\t4. OAuth\n2. User verifies identity\n3. successful connection",
			"styleAttributes":{"border":"dashed"},
			"x":-1320,
			"y":-505,
			"width":260,
			"height":230
		},
		{
			"id":"9ca7e92ada7f3946",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"## required design\n\n1. user\n2. ChatGPT\n3. login/authorize CRM through IAM\n4. IAM says: \"this is Pavan\"\n5. MCP receives trusted identity\n6. MCP knows:\n\t1. This is Pavan\n\t2. ORG ABC\n7. CRM determines\n\t1. Workspace is sales\n\t2. permission = contacts.create\n8. tool executes\n9. CRM",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1100,
			"y":-820,
			"width":380,
			"height":440
		},
		{
			"id":"b42869fce7d37a87",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"MCP\n\nHere MCP extracts the identity from the validated token",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1780,
			"y":-490,
			"width":260,
			"height":160
		},
		{
			"id":"bbf84079fd4e6141",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"CRM backend",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1780,
			"y":-270,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"e9591971c98aabf2",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"existing CRM authentication/RBAC",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1780,
			"y":-150,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"5465d867a9066798",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"CRM action",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1780,
			"y":-30,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"79438d4aad0c4189",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"trusted access token",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1780,
			"y":-610,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"0b2d20174a42fd06",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"IAM",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1780,
			"y":-730,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"ffb6aa539a9f670e",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"ChatGPT ",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1780,
			"y":-970,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"9041e51e1b5363bc",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"OAuth",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1780,
			"y":-850,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"b5f791ed9342318d",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Sales User",
			"styleAttributes":{"shape":"circle","textAlign":"center"},
			"x":-700,
			"y":440,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"612fd0359116f764",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"ChatGPT",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center","shape":"pill"},
			"x":-700,
			"y":630,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"60ef5bfdba7bbf82",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"## 2. What happens when you add multiple applications?\n\n\n```\nMCP\n │\n ├── Kruise CRM\n │    ├── contacts\n │    ├── leads\n │    └── deals\n │\n ├── Kruise Workflow\n │    ├── workflow tools\n │    └── task tools\n │\n ├── Another Application\n │    ├── tool A\n │    └── tool B\n │\n └── Another Application\n      ├── tool X\n      └── tool Y\n```",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2260,
			"y":-370,
			"width":960,
			"height":560
		},
		{
			"id":"1e791b048252893b",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"## 1. Do we call IAM every time?\n\nNo. \n\n```\nFirst time\n\n1. ChatGPT\n2. Kruise MCP\n3. \"I need authentication\"\n4. Kruise IAM\n5. User login / consents\n6. Access token\n7. ChatGPT stores the connection\n```\n\n```\nAfter that\nUser: create Rahul contact\n\n1. ChatGPT\n2. MCP\n3. Authorization: Bearer <access-token>\n4. validate token\n5. CRM action\n```\n\n**OpenAI's current MCP authentication documentation says that after the OAuth flow, ChatGPT attaches the access token to subsequent MCP requests. It also says the OAuth client registration can be reused for the MCP connection**",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2260,
			"y":-1190,
			"width":960,
			"height":690
		},
		{
			"id":"778a225869d02480",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Keehoo MCP dev route",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":-700,
			"y":930,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"02e44f80f9e28e0f",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"check URL secrets and dev-only switch, validate input. ",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":-260,
			"y":920,
			"width":300,
			"height":80
		},
		{
			"id":"991301690caba9a1",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Keehoo IAM",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":-700,
			"y":1080,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"ffe6c4dfa2323882",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Kruise CRM API",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":-700,
			"y":1240,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"852f1395ab84f92f",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"```json\n{\n  name: \"kruisecrm.create_contact\",\n\n  application: \"kruise-crm\",\n\n  requiredScopes: [\n    \"contacts.write\"\n  ]\n}\n```",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2260,
			"y":270,
			"width":520,
			"height":280
		},
		{
			"id":"e44a24afdf8b1e95",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"## architecture becomes\n\n1. Exisiting MCP platform\n\t1. Kruise CRM\n\t\t1. CRM tools\n\t\t\t1. CRM backend\n\t2. Kruise Workflow\n\t\t1. workflow tools\n\t\t\t1. workflow backend\n\t3. other apps\n\t\t1. other app tools\n\t\t\t1. other app backend",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2840,
			"y":270,
			"width":580,
			"height":360
		},
		{
			"id":"c13797d7145b619d",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"## what happens when the token expires? \n\nIt can use the re-fresh or re-authorization flow. \n\n1. Access token valid\n2. use it\n\nelse:\n1. Access token expired? \n2. refresh token\n3. new access token\n4. continue",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":3340,
			"y":-1140,
			"width":640,
			"height":360
		},
		{
			"id":"77d8bd8febb7cbde",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"https://developers.openai.com/plugins/build/auth?utm_source=chatgpt.com",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":3420,
			"y":-680,
			"width":620,
			"height":80
		},
		{
			"id":"d06a108d3bd05644",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"for normal /mcp endpoint:\n\n1. client\n2. bearer MCP JWT\n3. MCP validates token\n4. MCP identifies the tenat\n5. tool executes",
			"styleAttributes":{"border":"dashed"},
			"x":520,
			"y":-390,
			"width":340,
			"height":260
		}
	],
